00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:05.480
So Chaos is about learning
about our systems.

00:01:05.480 --> 00:01:07.140
So more fun quotes--

00:01:07.140 --> 00:01:08.760
I love this quote
from Barack Obama

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:12.210
