so you can actually have
nice summaries of what

00:34:43.260 --> 00:34:44.699
you've been doing.

00:34:44.699 --> 00:34:46.679
A few other things--

00:34:46.679 --> 00:34:48.690
Gremlin, I know, they are
sponsoring downstairs.

00:34:48.690 --> 00:34:51.120
But Gremlin is
Chaos as a service.

00:34:51.120 --> 00:34:52.739
They rolled out a
free service, which

00:34:52.739 --> 00:34:56.550
allows you to essentially
do node killing,

00:34:56.550 --> 00:35:01.090
or service killing, and then
also CPU tests, as well.

00:35:01.090 --> 00:35:02.578
So those are available freely.

00:35:02.578 --> 00:35:04.620
They integrate with Datadog,
so it's really cool.

00:35:04.620 --> 00:35:07.260
If you do use Datadog, you
can launch those directly

00:35:07.260 --> 00:35:08.138
from your dashboards.

00:35:08.138 --> 00:35:09.930
It lets you know when
the test was running.

00:35:09.930 --> 00:35:11.850
It allows you to
monitor your metrics

00:35:11.850 --> 00:35:14.010
through the course of the test.

00:35:14.010 --> 00:35:15.390
And then, finally,
Chaos Toolkit,

00:35:15.390 --> 00:35:18.090
another great resource--
they have a bunch

00:35:18.090 --> 00:35:19.740
of information on
how to run Chaos

00:35:19.740 --> 00:35:22.620
experiments, a bunch of tools
that you can actually use,

00:35:22.620 --> 00:35:25.050
as well.

00:35:25.050 --> 00:35:26.990
So with that said,
open the questions.

00:35:26.990 --> 00:35:29.690
So if you think of anything
afterward, you leave here,

00:35:29.690 --> 00:35:31.610
and you're like, oh,
I wish I knew more

00:35:31.610 --> 00:35:34.220
about this, feel
free to email me,

00:35:34.220 --> 00:35:35.582
or that's my Twitter handle.

00:35:35.582 --> 00:35:37.790
You can tweet at me, and
I'll answer those questions,

00:35:37.790 --> 00:35:39.560
as well.

00:35:39.560 --> 00:35:41.860
And then these slides
are available online.

00:35:41.860 --> 00:35:45.130
And the documents of the
experiment that we just ran--

00:35:45.130 --> 00:35:48.070
those are available
in the Gist, as well.

